                oa:exact "And so, yeah, so I'm looking for introductions to organizations that are individuals and organizations that are running a lot of calls that they use AI transcription tools with, which is quite the list of people at this point. And that I'm looking for introductions to funders. I'm raising 500k at this point to do a bridge round to get me to enough enterprise traction that I can do a true, you know, million seed." ;
                oa:prefix "ert:** Yeah.\n\n**Tanya Team:** " ;
